 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "A farmer drips milk down his chicken's neck, because the chicken has no head.",
   "words": [
    0,
    13
   ],
   "subject": "farmer"
  },
  {
   "text": "It's 1945 in Colorado, and he has a whole yard of chickens to get ready for dinner.",
   "words": [
    14,
    30
   ],
   "subject": "farmer"
  },
  {
   "text": "So he swings the axe, and one rooster just stands up and walks away like nothing happened.",
   "words": [
    31,
    47
   ],
   "subject": "farmer",
   "nouns": [
    {
     "word": "axe",
     "n": 1,
     "show": "axe"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The next morning he's still in the yard, trying to peck at corn with nothing to peck with,",
   "words": [
    48,
    65
   ],
   "subject": "mike"
  },
  {
   "text": "so the farmer sighs and goes to find an eyedropper.",
   "words": [
    66,
    75
   ],
   "subject": "farmer",
   "nouns": [
    {
     "word": "eyedropper",
     "n": 1,
     "show": "eyedropper"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "A neighbour leans on the fence and goes, \"You're feeding a chicken with no face? He's still dinner.\"",
   "words": [
    76,
    93
   ],
   "subject": "neighbour"
  },
  {
   "text": "The farmer says nothing, and he squeezes in another drop of milk and water.",
   "words": [
    94,
    107
   ],
   "subject": "farmer"
  },
  {
   "text": "A week later the rooster is strutting around the yard, trying to crow with nothing to crow with.",
   "words": [
    108,
    125
   ],
   "subject": "mike"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then scientists from a university drive out, and they poke him all over, and they can't find a thing wrong.",
   "words": [
    126,
    145
   ],
   "subject": "sci1"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then a showman takes him on tour, and people pay a quarter each just to look at him.",
   "words": [
    146,
    163
   ],
   "subject": "showman",
   "nouns": [
    {
     "word": "quarter",
     "n": 1,
     "show": "quarter"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The neighbour keeps leaning on the fence, but he's not laughing anymore.",
   "words": [
    164,
    175
   ],
   "subject": "neighbour"
  },
  {
   "text": "You see, the axe missed one big vein, and it left the bottom of the brain.",
   "words": [
    176,
    191
   ],
   "subject": "lady"
  },
  {
   "text": "That's the part that runs the heartbeat and the breathing,",
   "words": [
    192,
    201
   ],
   "subject": "lady"
  },
  {
   "text": "like how your legs keep walking while your head is busy thinking about something else.",
   "words": [
    202,
    216
   ],
   "subject": "lady"
  },
  {
   "text": "So the rooster everyone called Mike lives another eighteen months,",
   "words": [
    217,
    226
   ],
   "subject": "mike"
  },
  {
   "text": "and the farmer feeds him with the eyedropper every single day.",
   "words": [
    227,
    237
   ],
   "subject": "farmer"
  },
  {
   "text": "And now the town that was supposed to eat him throws him a party every year.",
   "words": [
    238,
    253
   ],
   "subject": "mike"
  }
 ],
